g at default 4.5), clicking 'Create Product' succeeded with a 'Product created successfully' toast and the product ('Test Validation Product') was added to the admin list with no image, no retailer link, and no specifications — violating the requirement that a product cannot be published without a complete image, valid retailer link, and ≥1 complete spec.\", \"evidence\": \"Admin product grid now shows 'Test Validation Product' card with $0 price, 4.5 rating, Tech category, and a broken/empty image, created despite missing Image URL, Affiliate Link, and Specifications fields.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/nonexistent-slug-xyz shows 'Product Not Found' message with link back to products, no unrelated product data shown. /category/nonexistent shows 'Category Not Found' message, no unrelated product data shown.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into the search box on /products updated the product set and result count instantly (9->1 for 'sony', then to Peloton for 'cardio') without any page reload/navigation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /products, clicking the Sony WH-1000XM5 product image (which is wrapped in the same link as the name) navigated to /product/sony-wh-1000xm5 detail page. List cards wrap both image and name/heading in links pointing to the same /product/:slug route.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Buy Now links have target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' and href pointing to external retailer domains, e.g. https://example.com/sony-xm5, https://example.com/macbook-pro, https://example.com/s24-ultra — confirming they open the external retailer page in a new tab.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Selecting 'Tech Gadgets' in the category dropdown on /products immediately updated the active category and filtered product list to 3 Tech items without reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/sony-wh-1000xm5 detail page displays: name (h1 'Sony WH-1000XM5'), category badge 'Tech', star rating '4.8', price '$399', short description, full 'My Review' paragraph, tag chips (headphones/wireless/noise-cancelling/premium), 'Key Specifications' grid (Driver Size, Battery Life, Weight, Bluetooth, Noise Cancelling), product image, and 'Buy Now' external retailer action — all fields present matching list-view values (Tech, $399, 4.8, same description).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sony WH-1000XM5 detail page shows relevant tags (headphones/wireless/noise-cancelling/premium) matching its product type. Searching '/products?search=noise-cancelling' (submitted via header search box) returned exactly '1 product found': Sony WH-1000XM5 — confirming the tag value shown on the detail page is the same value indexed for keyword search, demonstrating consistency between browsing/search and detail views.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sony WH-1000XM5 shows identical name, category (Tech), price ($399), rating (4.8), and description ('Industry-leading noise cancellation with exceptional sound quality and all-day comfort.') across homepage (Editor's Top Picks + Tech Gadgets row), /products listing, and /product/sony-wh-1000xm5 detail page. Detail page additionally shows the full untruncated 'My Review' paragraph and full Key Specifications grid not shown in list views.\"}]}"
